### Handy requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or copy them into Thunder Client / Postman)
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Amine", "email": "amine@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

### Login (copy the token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "amine@example.com", "password": "secret123" }

### Products (public)
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create product (replace TOKEN)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{ "name": "Test phone", "description": "Demo", "price": 199.9, "category": "Electronics", "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/400", "stock": 12 }

### Protected request without token -> 401
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/000000000000000000000000

### Invalid ID -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/products/abc
